* CHANGE LOG
* 2008-10-14 DPS  ORIGINAL
* 2016-04-25 AKW  LPER FIELDS - AUTOPAY
* 2020-04-06 AKW  FORBEARANCE STATUS
LNINQUS  DFHMSD TYPE=&SYSPARM,MODE=INOUT,LANG=COBOL,                   X
               CTRL=(FREEKB,FRSET),STORAGE=AUTO,TIOAPFX=YES,           X
               DSATTS=(COLOR,HILIGHT),MAPATTS=(COLOR,HILIGHT)
